<title>USA: PXRE to buy back up to 1.9 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>PXRE to buy back up to 1.9 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>EDISON, NJ 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PXRE Corp said Thursday its board of directors has authorized the repurcase of up to 1.9 million of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it recently completed the repurchase of 632,400 shares under a previously announced repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchased shares will be added to its treasury shares and will be available for general corporate purchases.</p>
<p>The company also said its board of directors declared a quartery cash dividend of $0.21 per share payable on June 3, 1997, to stockholders of record as of May 15, 1997.</p>
